('a4e11029-5d29-5340-8c11-977c5f06cd02','f8274e7b-1e6a-57b5-85fb-df3512f4d12a',2,'conjunction','A1','S1','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"as yet","register":null,"definition_en":"until and including the present time – used to say that something has not happened although it may happen in the future","translation":"تا و از جمله زمان حال - معمولاً می گفت که چیزی اتفاق نیفتاده است اگرچه ممکن است در آینده اتفاق بیفتد","example":"We’ve had no word from Colin as yet.","example_translation":"ما هنوز هیچ خبری از کالین نداشتیم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000991312.mp3"},{"phrase":"as it is","register":null,"definition_en":"because of the situation that actually exists – used when that situation is different from what you expected or needed","translation":"به دلیل موقعیتی که واقعاً وجود دارد - زمانی استفاده می شود که آن موقعیت با آنچه انتظار داشتید یا نیاز داشتید متفاوت باشد","example":"They hoped to finish the kitchen by Friday, but as it is they’ll probably have to come back next week.","example_translation":"آنها امیدوار بودند که آشپزخانه را تا جمعه تمام کنند، اما همانطور که هست احتمالا باید هفته آینده برگردند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000991351.mp3"},{"phrase":"as against something","register":null,"definition_en":"in comparison with something","translation":"در مقایسه با چیزی","example":"Profits this year are $2.5 million as against $4 million last year.","example_translation":"سود امسال 2.5 میلیون دلار در مقابل 4 میلیون دلار در سال گذشته است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000991369.mp3"},{"phrase":"as to something","register":"formal","definition_en":"concerning something","translation":"در مورد چیزی","example":"Frank was very uncertain as to whether it was the right job for him.","example_translation":"فرانک در مورد اینکه آیا این شغل برای او مناسب است یا نه، بسیار نامطمئن بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000991373.mp3"},{"phrase":"as it were","register":null,"definition_en":"used when describing someone or something in a way that is not quite exact","translation":"هنگامی که کسی یا چیزی را به گونه ای توصیف می کند که کاملاً دقیق نیست استفاده می شود","example":"Jim Radcliffe became our idol, as it were, the man we all wanted to be.","example_translation":"جیم رادکلیف تبدیل به بت ما شد، همان مردی که همه ما دوست داشتیم باشیم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000991386.mp3"},{"phrase":"as you do","register":"spoken","definition_en":"in the way that people usually do something or how they normally behave – often used humorously by people after they have mentioned doing something strange or unusual","translation":"به روشی که مردم معمولاً کاری را انجام می دهند یا به طور معمول چگونه رفتار می کنند - اغلب توسط افراد پس از اشاره به انجام کاری عجیب یا غیرعادی به صورت طنز استفاده می شود.","example":"We talked, exchanged email addresses and phone numbers, as you do on planes.","example_translation":"ما صحبت کردیم، آدرس ایمیل و شماره تلفن را رد و بدل کردیم، همانطور که شما در هواپیما انجام می دهید.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002096130.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
('e9b50ed5-4428-5cd3-8d18-44986cd2f05b','ce488f93-b738-5566-bdf4-3ca8ba23a4b5',1,'preposition','A1','S1','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"be at it again","register":"informal","definition_en":"if you say that someone is at it again, you mean that they are doing something you disapprove of, which they have done before","translation":"اگر می گویید که شخصی دوباره در حال انجام آن است، به این معناست که او کاری را انجام می دهد که شما آن را قبول ندارید، کاری که قبلا انجام داده است.","example":"She’s at it again, interfering in other people’s business.","example_translation":"او دوباره این کار را می کند و در کار دیگران دخالت می کند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813980.mp3"},{"phrase":"at that","register":null,"definition_en":"also or besides","translation":"همچنین یا علاوه بر آن","example":"It’s a new idea, and a good one, at that.","example_translation":"این یک ایده جدید است و در آن ایده خوبی است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000994286.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
('58376fef-433d-54cc-8e1b-6073d6de0951','74e155d0-82ae-5003-b9a9-d57fc17ae463',1,'auxiliary verb','A1','S1','W1','( past tense was , were , past participle been , present participle being , first person singular am , second person singular and plural are , third person singular is )','[{"phrase":"be to do something","register":"formal","definition_en":"used to talk about arrangements for the future","translation":"در مورد ترتیبات آینده صحبت می کرد","example":"Audrey and Jimmy are to be married in June.","example_translation":"آدری و جیمی قرار است در ماه ژوئن ازدواج کنند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788421.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
('6a54086b-7d00-54e3-b030-397f1d5a090a','74e155d0-82ae-5003-b9a9-d57fc17ae463',2,'verb','A1','S1','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"be that as it may","register":"formal","definition_en":"used to say that even though you accept that something is true , it does not change a situation","translation":"می گفت با وجود اینکه قبول دارید که چیزی درست است، اما شرایط را تغییر نمی دهد","example":"‘He was only joking.’ ‘Be that as it may, silly remarks like that can do a lot of harm.’","example_translation":"«او فقط شوخی می‌کرد.» «هرچند که ممکن است، چنین اظهارات احمقانه‌ای می‌تواند آسیب زیادی به همراه داشته باشد.»","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001004739.mp3"},{"phrase":"be yourself","register":null,"definition_en":"to behave in a natural way, rather than trying to pretend to be different","translation":"به جای تلاش برای متفاوت بودن وانمود کردن به شیوه ای طبیعی رفتار کنید","example":"Don’t try too hard – just be yourself.","example_translation":"خیلی تلاش نکنید - فقط خودتان باشید.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788506.mp3"},{"phrase":"not be yourself","register":null,"definition_en":"to be behaving in a way that is unusual for you, especially because you are ill or upset","translation":"به گونه ای رفتار کنید که برای شما غیرعادی است، به خصوص به دلیل اینکه بیمار هستید یا ناراحت هستید","example":"Sorry – I’m not myself this morning.","example_translation":"متاسفم - امروز صبح خودم نیستم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788511.mp3"},{"phrase":"the be-all and end-all","register":null,"definition_en":"the most important part of a situation or of someone’s life","translation":"مهمترین بخش یک موقعیت یا زندگی کسی است","example":"For Jim, making money was the be-all and end-all of his job.","example_translation":"برای جیم، پول درآوردن همه چیز و پایان کار او بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001004758.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
('cba89e13-ab09-535e-bf1f-14a7c4e1243f','74e155d0-82ae-5003-b9a9-d57fc17ae463',3,'prefix','A1',null,null,null,'[]'::jsonb),
('d5887e3b-0085-5190-bcd4-133c97fa9de6','b2d0a522-b3fd-5239-bfa2-acde81892a65',1,'preposition','A1','S1','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"by the by","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used when mentioning something that may be interesting but is not particularly important","translation":"هنگام ذکر چیزی که ممکن است جالب باشد اما اهمیت خاصی ندارد استفاده می شود","example":"By the by, Ian said he might call round tonight.","example_translation":"در کنار، ایان گفت که ممکن است امشب تماس بگیرد.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788379.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
('751e22f5-1e5c-579e-9640-1b7b2c1dd7a7','b2d0a522-b3fd-5239-bfa2-acde81892a65',2,'adverb','A1','S1','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"by and large","register":null,"definition_en":"used when making a general statement","translation":"هنگام بیان یک بیانیه کلی استفاده می شود","example":"By and large, the new arrangements have worked well.","example_translation":"به طور کلی، ترتیبات جدید به خوبی کار کرده است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788686.mp3"},{"phrase":"by and by","register":"old use","definition_en":"soon","translation":"به زودی","example":"She will be better by and by.","example_translation":"او همیشه بهتر خواهد شد.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788688.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
