('890127f6-125a-5fa7-a896-ee14755db361','37610db5-d912-53ab-8935-181ace6b525b',1,'noun','A1','S1','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"a breath of fresh air","register":null,"definition_en":"something that is new and different in a way you think is exciting and good","translation":"چیزی که جدید و متفاوت است به گونه ای که فکر می کنید هیجان انگیز و خوب است","example":"Osborne’s play brought a breath of fresh air to the British theatre.","example_translation":"بازی آزبورن نفسی تازه به تئاتر بریتانیا آورد.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001036489.mp3"},{"phrase":"the air","register":null,"definition_en":"the space above the ground or around things","translation":"فضای بالای زمین یا اطراف اشیا","example":"Flames leapt into the air.","example_translation":"شعله های آتش به هوا پرید.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603848.mp3"},{"phrase":"be in the air","register":null,"definition_en":"if a feeling is in the air , a lot of people feel it at the same time","translation":"اگر احساسی در هوا باشد، بسیاری از مردم آن را همزمان احساس می کنند","example":"There was a sense of excitement in the air.","example_translation":"یه حس هیجانی تو هوا بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603857.mp3"},{"phrase":"be up in the air","register":null,"definition_en":"if something is up in the air, no decision has been made about it yet","translation":"اگر چیزی در هوا است، هنوز تصمیمی در مورد آن گرفته نشده است","example":"Our trip is still very much up in the air.","example_translation":"سفر ما هنوز در هواست.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603870.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
('c5e476e8-d0b7-5767-8202-f2a3c0aea02e','37610db5-d912-53ab-8935-181ace6b525b',2,'verb','A1',null,null,null,'[]'::jsonb),
('658982f4-fd53-5219-a149-93056d40309a','f166e00b-add7-5729-8bdf-2f06aae4bf29',1,'determiner','A1','S1','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"at all","register":null,"definition_en":"used in negative statements and questions to emphasize what you are saying","translation":"در جملات و سؤالات منفی برای تأکید بر آنچه می گویید استفاده می شود","example":"They’ve done nothing at all to try and put the problem right.","example_translation":"آنها اصلاً هیچ کاری برای رفع مشکل انجام نداده اند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813561.mp3"},{"phrase":"all in all","register":null,"definition_en":"used to show that you are considering every part of a situation","translation":"برای نشان دادن اینکه شما هر بخش از یک موقعیت را در نظر می گیرید استفاده می شود","example":"All in all, it had been one of the most miserable days of Henry’s life.","example_translation":"در مجموع، یکی از بدترین روزهای زندگی هنری بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813580.mp3"},{"phrase":"for all something","register":null,"definition_en":"in spite of a particular fact","translation":"با وجود یک واقعیت خاص","example":"For all his faults, he’s a kind-hearted old soul.","example_translation":"با وجود تمام خطاهایش، او یک روح پیر مهربان است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813584.mp3"},{"phrase":"and all","register":"spoken","definition_en":"including the thing or things just mentioned","translation":"از جمله چیز یا چیزهایی که ذکر شد","example":"They ate the whole fish – head, bones, tail, and all.","example_translation":"آنها تمام ماهی را خوردند - سر، استخوان، دم، و همه.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813595.mp3"},{"phrase":"give your all","register":null,"definition_en":"to make the greatest possible effort in order to achieve something","translation":"بیشترین تلاش ممکن را برای رسیدن به چیزی انجام دهد","example":"The coach expects every player to give their all in every game.","example_translation":"مربی از هر بازیکنی انتظار دارد در هر بازی تمام تلاش خود را به خرج دهد.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813615.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
('a7f3cd57-cff4-5abc-aaed-91e6d321dfe9','f166e00b-add7-5729-8bdf-2f06aae4bf29',2,'adverb','A1','S1','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"all but","register":null,"definition_en":"almost completely","translation":"تقریبا به طور کامل","example":"Britain’s coal industry has all but disappeared.","example_translation":"صنعت زغال سنگ بریتانیا کاملاً ناپدید شده است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813747.mp3"},{"phrase":"all too","register":null,"definition_en":"used to mean ‘very’ when talking about a bad situation","translation":"هنگامی که در مورد یک موقعیت بد صحبت می شود به معنای \"بسیار\" بود","example":"All too often it’s the mother who gets blamed for her children’s behaviour.","example_translation":"اغلب اوقات این مادر است که به خاطر رفتار فرزندانش سرزنش می شود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000977758.mp3"},{"phrase":"all along","register":"informal","definition_en":"all the time from the beginning while something was happening","translation":"تمام مدت از ابتدا در حالی که اتفاقی در حال رخ دادن بود","example":"Chapman had known all along that the plan wouldn’t work.","example_translation":"چپمن از تمام مدت می دانست که این طرح عملی نخواهد شد.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813750.mp3"},{"phrase":"all round","register":null,"definition_en":"good at doing many different things","translation":"در انجام بسیاری از کارهای مختلف خوب است","example":"an all-round athlete","example_translation":"یک ورزشکار همه جانبه","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000979775.mp3"},{"phrase":"all told","register":null,"definition_en":"including everything or everyone","translation":"از جمله همه چیز یا همه","example":"a project costing £10,000, all told","example_translation":"پروژه ای با هزینه 10000 پوند، همه گفته شد","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813753.mp3"},{"phrase":"be not all there","register":"informal","definition_en":"someone who is not all there seems stupid or slightly crazy","translation":"کسی که همه آنجا نیست احمق یا کمی دیوانه به نظر می رسد","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"be all over somebody","register":"informal","definition_en":"to be trying to kiss someone and touch them, especially in a sexual way","translation":"تلاش برای بوسیدن کسی و لمس کردن او، به خصوص از راه جنسی","example":"Before I could speak, he was all over me.","example_translation":"قبل از اینکه بتونم حرف بزنم، او تمام وجودم را گرفته بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813768.mp3"},{"phrase":"be all in","register":null,"definition_en":"to be very tired","translation":"خیلی خسته بودن","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"not all that","register":null,"definition_en":"not very","translation":"نه خیلی","example":"It doesn’t sound all that good, does it?","example_translation":"آنقدرها هم خوب به نظر نمی رسد، اینطور نیست؟","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001840231.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
