('e89bf105-18f5-555c-a398-6966698684ca','07f272c8-6fe7-5e0b-bb7d-bb8e94e9914c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to refer to a thing, animal , situation , idea etc that has already been mentioned or is already known about',null,null,'آن، او (جانور/چیز)؛ به‌عنوان موضوع جمله','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘Where’s your office?’ ‘It’s on the third floor.’","translation":"«دفتر شما کجاست؟» «در طبقه سوم است.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001394622.mp3"},{"sentence":"I love the spring – it’s a wonderful time of the year.","translation":"من بهار را دوست دارم - زمان فوق العاده ای از سال است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001394620.mp3"},{"sentence":"There were people crying, buildings on fire. It was terrible!","translation":"مردم گریه می کردند، ساختمان ها آتش گرفته بودند. وحشتناک بود!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001394621.mp3"},{"sentence":"Don’t blame me. It wasn’t my idea.","translation":"مرا سرزنش نکن این ایده من نبود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788025.mp3"},{"sentence":"This little beast is a lemur and it lives in Madagascar.","translation":"این جانور کوچک یک لمور است و در ماداگاسکار زندگی می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788026.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('6d1b5c85-1e9c-51aa-b8fc-e7938679998f','07f272c8-6fe7-5e0b-bb7d-bb8e94e9914c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used to refer to the situation that someone is in now, or what is happening now',null,null,'قبلاً به وضعیتی اشاره می کرد که اکنون کسی در آن قرار دارد یا آنچه اکنون در حال وقوع است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I can’t stand it any longer. I’m resigning.","translation":"من دیگر نمی توانم تحمل کنم. من استعفا می دهم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001394626.mp3"},{"sentence":"How’s it going, Bob? I haven’t seen you for ages.","translation":"اوضاع چطوره، باب؟ سالهاست ندیدهمت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001394627.mp3"},{"sentence":"And the worst of it is the car isn’t even paid for yet.","translation":"و بدترین آن این است که ماشین هنوز پولی دریافت نکرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001394628.mp3"},{"sentence":"Stop it, you two. You’re just being silly.","translation":"بس کن شما دوتا فقط داری احمق میشی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788027.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('3d23596f-2eb4-5aab-9dc1-f1bcc52fb73f','07f272c8-6fe7-5e0b-bb7d-bb8e94e9914c',3,null,null,'spoken & written','used as the subject or object of a verb when the real subject or object is later in the sentence',null,null,'هنگامی که فاعل یا مفعول واقعی در بعد جمله باشد به عنوان فاعل یا مفعول یک فعل استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It worries me the way he keeps changing his mind.","translation":"این مرا نگران می کند که او مدام نظرش را تغییر می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001394632.mp3"},{"sentence":"What’s it like being a sailor?","translation":"ملوان بودن چگونه است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001394633.mp3"},{"sentence":"Apparently it’s cheaper to fly than to go by train.","translation":"ظاهراً پرواز ارزانتر از رفتن با قطار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001394634.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s a pity you couldn’t come.","translation":"حیف که نتونستی بیای","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001394635.mp3"},{"sentence":"It seems that we are not welcome here.","translation":"به نظر می رسد که ما اینجا استقبال نمی کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788028.mp3"},{"sentence":"I found it hard to concentrate.","translation":"برایم سخت بود که تمرکز کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788029.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('4ed2feb0-d7db-5e87-a51f-d57b9c681bdd','07f272c8-6fe7-5e0b-bb7d-bb8e94e9914c',4,null,null,'spoken & written','used as the subject of a sentence when you are talking about the weather , the time, a distance etc',null,null,'هنگامی که در مورد آب و هوا، زمان، مسافت و غیره صحبت می کنید به عنوان موضوع جمله استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Is it still raining?","translation":"آیا هنوز باران می بارد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001394641.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was 4 o''clock and the mail still hadn’t come.","translation":"ساعت 4 بود و نامه هنوز نیامده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001394640.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s my birthday today.","translation":"امروز تولد منه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001394642.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s over 200 miles from London to Manchester.","translation":"از لندن تا منچستر بیش از 200 مایل فاصله دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001394639.mp3"},{"sentence":"It gets dark very early in the winter.","translation":"در زمستان خیلی زود تاریک می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788030.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s three years since I last saw her.","translation":"سه سال از آخرین باری که او را دیدم می گذرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788031.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('8eccea11-7ee2-51d0-bf0e-65478b233145','07f272c8-6fe7-5e0b-bb7d-bb8e94e9914c',5,null,null,'spoken & written','used with the verb ‘be’ to emphasize that you are talking about one particular thing, person, group etc and not any other',null,null,'با فعل "be" برای تاکید بر اینکه شما در مورد یک چیز خاص، شخص، گروه و غیره صحبت می کنید و نه چیز دیگری استفاده می شود.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s Lawrence you should be talking to.","translation":"این لارنس است که باید با او صحبت کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788032.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was malaria that killed him.","translation":"مالاریا بود که او را کشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788033.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was in New Zealand that Elizabeth first met Mr Cronje.","translation":"در نیوزیلند بود که الیزابت برای اولین بار با آقای کرونژ ملاقات کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788034.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
