('500abff2-b97b-5dd5-9b89-84c27499f595','7a529a09-9271-5b02-97d8-69c0fd68adef',5,null,null,'spoken','sometimes used to mean ‘you’ when speaking to children or people who are ill',null,null,'گاهی اوقات هنگام صحبت با کودکان یا افرادی که بیمار هستند به معنای "شما" استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"How are we feeling today, Mr Robson?","translation":"امروز چه احساسی داریم، آقای رابسون؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000512026.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('863e6c35-87f8-57a5-925d-9fa5b876cc2e','eedd76d9-3796-5e5e-9777-a5fcb633a9d0',1,'action','اقدام','spoken & written','one thing that you do','[ countable ]',null,'عمل، کار؛ (ترسناک) قانون، لایحه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an act of violence/aggression Incidents of sexual harassment and acts of violence against women were on the increase.','an act of kindness/love We were grateful for her act of kindness.','an act of faith (= when you do something that shows you trust someone completely ) The signing of the treaty with Britain was an act of faith.','an act of terrorism (= when someone kills people or bombs a place for political reasons ) It was the worst act of terrorism in US history.','an act of vandalism (= when someone deliberately damages things, especially public property ) These mindless acts of vandalism affect the whole community.','an act of defiance (= when you refuse to obey or respect someone ) As an act of defiance Leigh dropped out of high school a month before graduation.','an act of courage/bravery The men were awarded the medals for acts of courage.','a criminal/illegal/unlawful act Starting the fire was a highly irresponsible criminal act.','a violent/aggressive act We will track down those responsible for this violent act.','terrorist acts terrorists acts like the Oklahoma City bombing','a cowardly act (= not at all brave ) The United States strongly condemns this cowardly act by murderous extremists.','a heroic act (= very brave ) Ordinary people sometimes find themselves performing heroic acts.','a deliberate/conscious act Clearly this was a deliberate act of vandalism.','a symbolic act (= something you do to express an idea or feeling ) The Tibetan climber will pass the Olympic flame to his Chinese partner in a symbolic act of friendship.','commit an act formal (= do something wrong or illegal ) Anyone committing an illegal act deserves to be punished.','perform an act (= do something, especially something difficult or useful ) The nurses performed many small acts of kindness.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The new president’s first act should be to end the war.","translation":"اولین اقدام رئیس جمهور جدید باید پایان دادن به جنگ باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000968101.mp3"},{"sentence":"a thoughtless act","translation":"یک عمل بی فکر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645592.mp3"},{"sentence":"an act of violence","translation":"یک عمل خشونت آمیز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645595.mp3"},{"sentence":"her many acts of kindness","translation":"بسیاری از اعمال مهربان او","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645596.mp3"},{"sentence":"The act of writing a list can help to calm you down.","translation":"عمل نوشتن یک لیست می تواند به شما کمک کند تا آرام شوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645597.mp3"},{"sentence":"Lindsay paused in the act of putting down the phone.","translation":"لیندسی در حالی که گوشی را کنار گذاشت مکث کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645601.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('c4f3f1af-2176-5f77-9579-0de36d5ae936','eedd76d9-3796-5e5e-9777-a5fcb633a9d0',2,'law','قانون','spoken & written','a law that has been officially accepted by Parliament or Congress','[ countable ]',null,'قانونی که به طور رسمی توسط پارلمان یا کنگره پذیرفته شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the Housing and Community Development Act of 1977","translation":"قانون توسعه مسکن و جامعه در سال 1977","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000968123.mp3"},{"sentence":"an act of Parliament","translation":"یک مصوبه مجلس","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000968124.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('27380153-dc98-5f14-a796-10b031fe8669','eedd76d9-3796-5e5e-9777-a5fcb633a9d0',3,'pretending','وانمود کردن','spoken & written','insincere behaviour in which you pretend to have a particular kind of feeling or to be a particular kind of person','[ singular ]',null,'رفتار غیر صمیمانه ای که در آن وانمود می کنید که نوع خاصی از احساس دارید یا نوع خاصی از فرد هستید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Mike played the loving husband in front of the children but it was all an act.","translation":"مایک نقش شوهر دوست داشتنی را در جلوی بچه ها بازی می کرد اما همه اینها یک عمل بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000968131.mp3"},{"sentence":"Be natural. Don’t feel you have to put on an act .","translation":"طبیعی باشید احساس نکنید که باید یک عمل انجام دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645609.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
