('995eb479-9134-520b-81bf-5fdf1fc3ea07','dc58beaf-8057-54e6-acef-b56a7e4c746d',1,null,null,'informal','an illness that people catch very easily from each other but is not very serious',null,null,'ویروس سرماخوردگی؛ حشره موذی؛ باگ نرم‌افزاری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a nasty/horrible bug It was a really nasty bug.','a stomach bug ( also a tummy bug more informal ) He’s off school with a stomach bug.','a flu bug We’ve all had a horrible flu bug.','a 24-hour/2-day etc bug The doctor says it’s just a 24-hour bug.','have a bug Two of us had a nasty bug on holiday.','catch/get a bug Six out of ten travellers get a stomach bug abroad.','pick up a bug (= catch one ) He seems to pick up every bug going.','a bug is going around (= a lot of people have it ) A lot of staff are off because there’s a bug going round.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I picked up a bug last weekend.","translation":"آخر هفته گذشته ایرادی پیدا کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001663663.mp3"},{"sentence":"There’s a nasty bug going round (= that a lot of people have caught ) .","translation":"یک حشره بد در راه است (= که بسیاری از مردم آن را گرفته اند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001663664.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s off work with a stomach bug.","translation":"او با مشکل معده از کار خارج شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001663672.mp3"},{"sentence":"a 24-hour flu bug","translation":"یک بیماری آنفولانزای 24 ساعته","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001783286.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
