('189a90fe-f779-5b3b-a7d3-c6a9a6b4ab2e','dc58beaf-8057-54e6-acef-b56a7e4c746d',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a fault in the system of instructions that operates a computer',null,'debug','نقص در سیستم دستورالعمل هایی که کامپیوتر را کار می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a nasty/horrible bug It was a really nasty bug.','a stomach bug ( also a tummy bug more informal ) He’s off school with a stomach bug.','a flu bug We’ve all had a horrible flu bug.','a 24-hour/2-day etc bug The doctor says it’s just a 24-hour bug.','have a bug Two of us had a nasty bug on holiday.','catch/get a bug Six out of ten travellers get a stomach bug abroad.','pick up a bug (= catch one ) He seems to pick up every bug going.','a bug is going around (= a lot of people have it ) A lot of staff are off because there’s a bug going round.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a bug in the software","translation":"یک باگ در نرم افزار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001663673.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c5863660-b49d-52dd-9ae6-e0b0d7c46291','dc58beaf-8057-54e6-acef-b56a7e4c746d',4,null,null,'spoken & written','a small piece of electronic equipment for listening secretly to other people’s conversations',null,null,'یک قطعه کوچک از تجهیزات الکترونیکی برای گوش دادن مخفیانه به مکالمات دیگران','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a nasty/horrible bug It was a really nasty bug.','a stomach bug ( also a tummy bug more informal ) He’s off school with a stomach bug.','a flu bug We’ve all had a horrible flu bug.','a 24-hour/2-day etc bug The doctor says it’s just a 24-hour bug.','have a bug Two of us had a nasty bug on holiday.','catch/get a bug Six out of ten travellers get a stomach bug abroad.','pick up a bug (= catch one ) He seems to pick up every bug going.','a bug is going around (= a lot of people have it ) A lot of staff are off because there’s a bug going round.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('58d668d2-ad69-5d61-8eac-10156fc533ac','dc58beaf-8057-54e6-acef-b56a7e4c746d',5,null,null,'informal','a sudden strong interest in doing something',null,null,'علاقه شدید ناگهانی به انجام کاری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a nasty/horrible bug It was a really nasty bug.','a stomach bug ( also a tummy bug more informal ) He’s off school with a stomach bug.','a flu bug We’ve all had a horrible flu bug.','a 24-hour/2-day etc bug The doctor says it’s just a 24-hour bug.','have a bug Two of us had a nasty bug on holiday.','catch/get a bug Six out of ten travellers get a stomach bug abroad.','pick up a bug (= catch one ) He seems to pick up every bug going.','a bug is going around (= a lot of people have it ) A lot of staff are off because there’s a bug going round.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She’s got the travel bug.","translation":"او مشکل سفر دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001663676.mp3"},{"sentence":"I had one flying lesson and immediately caught the bug (= became very interested in flying ) .","translation":"من یک درس پرواز داشتم و بلافاصله حشره را گرفتار کردم (= به پرواز بسیار علاقه مند شدم).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001663677.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('104efd84-0f10-5b06-8f6b-c1c15d2060b4','c68bb475-7bc7-5fee-a358-79a2098b5018',1,null,null,'informal','to annoy someone',null,null,'اذیت کردن کسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It just bugs me that I have to work so many extra hours for no extra money.","translation":"فقط من را آزار می دهد که مجبورم ساعت های زیادی بدون پول اضافی کار کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001041907.mp3"},{"sentence":"The baby’s crying is really bugging him.","translation":"گریه کودک واقعاً او را آزار می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001663684.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('4007235c-004e-57dc-a764-e3bbd6828cdc','c68bb475-7bc7-5fee-a358-79a2098b5018',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to put a bug (= small piece of electronic equipment ) somewhere secretly in order to listen to conversations',null,null,'قرار دادن یک باگ (= قطعه کوچک تجهیزات الکترونیکی) در جایی مخفیانه برای گوش دادن به مکالمات','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Do you think the room is bugged?","translation":"به نظر شما اتاق خراب است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001041917.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ed5abc6e-f733-5642-8957-2f049bbf5e20','79e45cdd-74b7-53be-9ed0-14906d4ac158',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a Beetle (= type of small Volkswagen car )',null,null,'یک سوسک (= نوع ماشین کوچک فولکس واگن)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('09b09c46-1219-5002-9590-9f1d3971d7c9','59294376-e7c9-5fb0-82a8-0dd89cac06b1',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a large vehicle that people pay to travel on',null,null,'اتوبوس','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['go/travel by bus I usually go to work by bus.','go on the bus/use the bus (= travel by bus ) It’s easier to go on the bus than to drive.','get/take/catch a bus Can we get a bus from here to Reading?','ride a bus American English It was the first time Craig had ridden a bus downtown by himself.','get on/off a bus Several more passengers got on the bus.','wait for a bus We were waiting for the bus for half an hour.','miss the bus (= be too late to get on a bus ) He woke up late and missed the bus.','a bus goes/leaves The last bus went ten minutes ago.','a bus comes/arrives I waited and waited but the bus didn’t come.','buses run (= go at regular times ) The buses run less frequently on a Sunday.','a bus ride/journey/trip It’s a 20-minute bus ride into town.','a bus stop (= a place where a bus stops for passengers ) She got off at the next bus stop.','a bus shelter (= a small covered area where you wait for a bus ) Some kids had vandalized the bus shelter.','a bus service (= a service that provides regular buses ) It’s a small village but there is a good bus service.','a bus route We live very near a main bus route.','a bus fare (= the money you pay for a bus journey ) Can you lend me 50p for my bus fare?','a bus ticket She lost her bus ticket.','a bus pass (= a ticket giving cheap or free bus travel ) Most of the students have a termly bus pass.','a bus station (= a place where buses start and finish their journeys ) Dad met me at the bus station.','a bus lane (= a part of the road where only buses are allowed to drive ) You can be fined for driving in a bus lane.','a bus driver She asked the bus driver where to get off for the Botanical Gardens.','a bus timetable The bus timetable changes on January 31st.','a bus queue British English (= a line of people waiting for a bus ) We were chatting while we stood in the bus queue.','a school bus Hurry up or you’ll miss the school bus!','a shuttle bus (= one that makes regular short journeys between two places ) There’s a shuttle bus between the hotel and the beach.','a double-decker bus (= one with two levels for passengers ) London used to be famous for its double-decker buses.','an open-topped bus (= one without a roof, used for showing tourists a town etc ) We took a tour on an open-topped bus.','a regular bus (= one that goes at regular times ) Regular buses run to the airport.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There were a lot of people on the bus.","translation":"افراد زیادی در اتوبوس بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001891324.mp3"},{"sentence":"The best way to get there is by bus.","translation":"بهترین راه برای رسیدن به آنجا با اتوبوس است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001891354.mp3"},{"sentence":"I took a bus to San Francisco.","translation":"با اتوبوس به سانفرانسیسکو رفتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000238.mp3"},{"sentence":"Buses run at 15 and 30 minutes past the hour.","translation":"اتوبوس ها در ساعت 15 و 30 دقیقه بعد از ساعت حرکت می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000239.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('936cafb0-85b4-581a-ad79-3d21dd190765','59294376-e7c9-5fb0-82a8-0dd89cac06b1',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a circuit that connects the main parts of a computer so that signals can be sent from one part of the computer to another',null,null,'مداری که قسمت های اصلی کامپیوتر را به هم متصل می کند تا سیگنال ها از یک قسمت کامپیوتر به قسمت دیگر ارسال شوند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['go/travel by bus I usually go to work by bus.','go on the bus/use the bus (= travel by bus ) It’s easier to go on the bus than to drive.','get/take/catch a bus Can we get a bus from here to Reading?','ride a bus American English It was the first time Craig had ridden a bus downtown by himself.','get on/off a bus Several more passengers got on the bus.','wait for a bus We were waiting for the bus for half an hour.','miss the bus (= be too late to get on a bus ) He woke up late and missed the bus.','a bus goes/leaves The last bus went ten minutes ago.','a bus comes/arrives I waited and waited but the bus didn’t come.','buses run (= go at regular times ) The buses run less frequently on a Sunday.','a bus ride/journey/trip It’s a 20-minute bus ride into town.','a bus stop (= a place where a bus stops for passengers ) She got off at the next bus stop.','a bus shelter (= a small covered area where you wait for a bus ) Some kids had vandalized the bus shelter.','a bus service (= a service that provides regular buses ) It’s a small village but there is a good bus service.','a bus route We live very near a main bus route.','a bus fare (= the money you pay for a bus journey ) Can you lend me 50p for my bus fare?','a bus ticket She lost her bus ticket.','a bus pass (= a ticket giving cheap or free bus travel ) Most of the students have a termly bus pass.','a bus station (= a place where buses start and finish their journeys ) Dad met me at the bus station.','a bus lane (= a part of the road where only buses are allowed to drive ) You can be fined for driving in a bus lane.','a bus driver She asked the bus driver where to get off for the Botanical Gardens.','a bus timetable The bus timetable changes on January 31st.','a bus queue British English (= a line of people waiting for a bus ) We were chatting while we stood in the bus queue.','a school bus Hurry up or you’ll miss the school bus!','a shuttle bus (= one that makes regular short journeys between two places ) There’s a shuttle bus between the hotel and the beach.','a double-decker bus (= one with two levels for passengers ) London used to be famous for its double-decker buses.','an open-topped bus (= one without a roof, used for showing tourists a town etc ) We took a tour on an open-topped bus.','a regular bus (= one that goes at regular times ) Regular buses run to the airport.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('4c3d2aa2-587a-54f7-be05-6252d1a2aa06','a6aaffb7-582b-5e9a-9313-ce61787172d9',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to take a person or a group of people somewhere in a bus',null,null,'بردن یک فرد یا گروهی از افراد به جایی در اتوبوس','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Casey was bussed to the school.","translation":"کیسی با اتوبوس به مدرسه رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001046886.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c7ac2f80-deee-5bd5-b700-52402903735e','a6aaffb7-582b-5e9a-9313-ce61787172d9',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to take away dirty dishes from the tables in a restaurant',null,null,'برای برداشتن ظروف کثیف از روی میزهای رستوران','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Shelley had a job bussing tables .","translation":"شلی شغلی داشت که میزهای اتوبوس را می زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001046895.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('abeafaa0-91ff-5081-8bd4-725b7ada326d','33cb2a21-0ebf-517b-8139-31183bc2fc41',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to connect two statements or phrases when the second one adds something different or seems surprising after the first one',null,null,'اما، ولی؛ اگر نه (مگر اینکه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s an old car, but it’s very reliable.","translation":"این یک ماشین قدیمی است، اما بسیار قابل اعتماد است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788638.mp3"},{"sentence":"They rushed to the hospital, but they were too late.","translation":"آنها سریع به بیمارستان رفتند، اما خیلی دیر شده بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001047433.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’ve invited the boss, but she may decide not to come.","translation":"ما رئیس را دعوت کرده ایم، اما او ممکن است تصمیم بگیرد که نیاید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001047434.mp3"},{"sentence":"an expensive but extremely useful book","translation":"یک کتاب گران قیمت اما بسیار مفید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001047439.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Has he got any experience?’ ‘No, but he’s keen to learn.’","translation":"\"آیا او تجربه ای دارد؟\" \"نه، اما او مشتاق یادگیری است.\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788639.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('f2368c1d-c629-554e-a0c0-61ba27b1a76e','33cb2a21-0ebf-517b-8139-31183bc2fc41',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used to introduce a statement that explains why the thing you have mentioned did not happen or is not possible',null,null,'برای معرفی عبارتی استفاده می شود که توضیح می دهد چرا اتفاقی که ذکر کردید رخ نداده یا ممکن نیست','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’d like to go but I’m too busy.","translation":"دوست دارم برم ولی سرم خیلی شلوغه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001047444.mp3"},{"sentence":"They would have married sooner, but they had to wait for her divorce.","translation":"آنها زودتر ازدواج می کردند، اما باید منتظر طلاق او بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001047443.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('96e06c34-9bea-5b4f-b446-8e57eee82827','33cb2a21-0ebf-517b-8139-31183bc2fc41',3,null,null,'spoken & written','used after a negative to emphasize that it is the second part of the sentence that is true',null,null,'بعد از منفی استفاده می شود تا تاکید شود که قسمت دوم جمله درست است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He lied to the court not just once, but on several occasions.","translation":"او نه تنها یک بار، بلکه در چندین نوبت به دادگاه دروغ گفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001047448.mp3"},{"sentence":"The purpose of the scheme is not to help the employers but to provide work for young people.","translation":"هدف از این طرح کمک به کارفرمایان نیست بلکه کار برای جوانان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001047449.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('77318f94-c273-54f1-bb05-358786522572','33cb2a21-0ebf-517b-8139-31183bc2fc41',4,null,null,'spoken & written','except',null,null,'جز','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"What can we do but sit and wait?","translation":"چه کنیم جز اینکه بنشینیم و منتظر بمانیم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788643.mp3"},{"sentence":"I had no choice but to accept the challenge.","translation":"چاره ای جز پذیرش چالش نداشتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788644.mp3"},{"sentence":"Not a day goes by but I think of dear old Larry (= I think of him every day ) .","translation":"روزی نمی گذرد اما به لری پیر عزیز فکر می کنم (= هر روز به او فکر می کنم).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788645.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('a9e6b0df-0f1b-5d26-abf4-c8ec2301e82d','33cb2a21-0ebf-517b-8139-31183bc2fc41',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'but for','اما، ولی؛ اگر نه (مگر اینکه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
