('96882c8a-35fc-5ef5-9c03-c16395303085','ba0cc462-32f6-5e2f-b2c9-7ca094288713',1,'hat','کلاه','spoken & written','a type of flat hat that has a curved part sticking out at the front , and is often worn as part of a uniform',null,null,'کلاه نقاب‌دار؛ درپوش؛ سقف (محدودیت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a baseball cap (= that people wear for baseball and for fashion ) He was wearing a sweater and a baseball cap.','a flat cap ( also a cloth cap ) British English (= made of cloth with a stiff piece that sticks out at the front ) We saw an old man in a jacket and a brown flat cap.','a peaked cap (= worn as part of a uniform ) She wore a sailor''s peaked cap.','a swimming/bathing cap A swimming cap will stop you getting your hair wet.','a shower cap (= worn to keep your hair dry when having a shower ) There was a little bag containing soap, shampoo and a shower cap.','wear a cap He was wearing a baseball cap.','put on/take off/remove your cap He opened the door, took off his cap, and threw it on a hook.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a baseball cap","translation":"کلاه بیسبال","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001655621.mp3"},{"sentence":"old men in flat caps","translation":"پیرمردهایی با کلاه های صاف","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001655622.mp3"},{"sentence":"a chauffeur’s peaked cap","translation":"کلاه اوج راننده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001655623.mp3"},{"sentence":"a swimming cap","translation":"کلاه شنا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001054700.mp3"},{"sentence":"a shower cap","translation":"یک کلاه دوش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001054701.mp3"},{"sentence":"a white lace cap","translation":"یک کلاه توری سفید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001655626.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
