('f0412bb1-251b-5a6a-9b83-1a950df6f29d','ab720744-90d8-50eb-883b-d3c60020c9f0',1,'reduce','کاهش دهد','spoken & written','to reduce the amount of something','[ transitive ]',null,'کاهش دادن؛ بریدن، قطع کردن؛ خط زدن (از فیلم)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['cut costs (= reduce the amount you spend running a business, a home etc ) They cut costs by getting rid of staff.','cut prices Shops have been forced to cut their prices after very slow sales.','cut taxes/rates The government is expected to cut interest rates next month.','cut spending/borrowing In the 1990s, governments worldwide cut military spending.','cut jobs The bank announced that it was cutting 500 jobs.','cut crime Cameras have helped to cut crime in the town centre.','sharply/severely/drastically (= cut a lot ) Housing benefit was sharply cut for all but the poorest people.','cut something to the bone (= reduce it to the lowest level possible ) Funding for art and music in schools has been cut to the bone.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"They’re introducing CCTV cameras in an attempt to cut street crime in the area.","translation":"آنها دوربین های مداربسته را در تلاش برای کاهش جرایم خیابانی در منطقه معرفی می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001123240.mp3"},{"sentence":"You need to cut the amount of fat and sugar in your diet.","translation":"شما باید میزان چربی و قند را در رژیم غذایی خود کاهش دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778314.mp3"},{"sentence":"Scientists are warning that unless carbon emissions are cut, we could be heading for an environmental catastrophe.","translation":"دانشمندان هشدار می دهند که اگر انتشار کربن کاهش نیابد، ممکن است به سمت یک فاجعه زیست محیطی پیش برویم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778315.mp3"},{"sentence":"Seven hundred jobs will be lost in order to cut costs and boost profits.","translation":"هفتصد شغل به منظور کاهش هزینه ها و افزایش سود از بین خواهد رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000413.mp3"},{"sentence":"The major aviation companies need to cut prices if they are to compete with budget airlines.","translation":"شرکت های بزرگ هواپیمایی برای رقابت با خطوط هوایی مقرون به صرفه باید قیمت ها را کاهش دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778320.mp3"},{"sentence":"The welfare budget has been cut by $56 billion.","translation":"بودجه رفاهی 56 میلیارد دلار کاهش یافته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001123243.mp3"},{"sentence":"A new direct service will cut two hours off the flying time between London and Seoul.","translation":"یک سرویس مستقیم جدید دو ساعت زمان پرواز بین لندن و سئول را کاهش می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001123246.mp3"},{"sentence":"Staffing levels had already been cut to the bone (= reduced to the lowest level possible ) .","translation":"سطح کارکنان قبلاً تا حد استخوان کاهش یافته بود (= به پایین ترین سطح ممکن کاهش یافته بود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778326.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
('b13764d5-d706-51e3-a5fb-c5a9c36149a5','ab720744-90d8-50eb-883b-d3c60020c9f0',2,'divide something with a knife, scissors etc','با چاقو، قیچی و غیره چیزی را تقسیم کنید','spoken & written','to divide something or separate something from its main part, using scissors, a knife etc','[ intransitive, transitive ]','cut out , cut up','تقسیم کردن چیزی یا جدا کردن چیزی از قسمت اصلی آن با استفاده از قیچی، چاقو و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Do you want me to cut the cake?","translation":"میخوای کیک رو برش بدم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001123150.mp3"},{"sentence":"The telephone wires had been cut minutes before the assault.","translation":"سیم های تلفن دقایقی قبل از حمله قطع شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001123151.mp3"},{"sentence":"Jane cut the cord with a knife.","translation":"جین بند ناف را با چاقو برید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778290.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can you cut me a piece of bread, please?","translation":"میشه لطفا یه لقمه نان منو برش بدی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778293.mp3"},{"sentence":"Using a pair of scissors, cut carefully along the dotted lines.","translation":"با استفاده از یک قیچی، خطوط نقطه چین را با دقت برش دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778301.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’ll need a saw that will cut through metal.","translation":"ما به اره ای نیاز داریم که فلز را برش دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778304.mp3"},{"sentence":"Cut the orange in half.","translation":"پرتقال را از وسط نصف کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001123154.mp3"},{"sentence":"Cut the carrots into thin strips.","translation":"هویج ها را به صورت نوارهای نازک برش دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778308.mp3"},{"sentence":"The curtain pole can be cut to length.","translation":"میله پرده را می توان به طول برش داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778312.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('d9ebebe6-f140-5a53-a1cd-09aaf3628fcb','ab720744-90d8-50eb-883b-d3c60020c9f0',3,'make something shorter with a knife etc','با چاقو چیزی کوتاه تر کنید و غیره','spoken & written','to make something shorter with a knife, scissors etc, especially in order to make it neater','[ transitive ]',null,'با چاقو، قیچی و غیره چیزی کوتاهتر بسازید، مخصوصاً برای اینکه آن را تمیزتر کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"For reasons of hygiene, we had to cut our fingernails really short.","translation":"به دلایل بهداشتی مجبور شدیم ناخن هایمان را خیلی کوتاه کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001977020.mp3"},{"sentence":"From outside came the sound of someone cutting the hedge.","translation":"از بیرون صدای کسی آمد که پرچین را برید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001977023.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s about time you got your hair cut.","translation":"وقت آن است که موهایتان را کوتاه کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001977026.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('ab7ded91-c3dd-5f41-8b7f-564821a0e396','ab720744-90d8-50eb-883b-d3c60020c9f0',4,'remove parts from film etc','قطعات را از فیلم بردارید و غیره','spoken & written','to remove parts from a film, book, speech etc, for example because it is too long or might offend people','[ transitive ]',null,'برای حذف قطعات از یک فیلم، کتاب، سخنرانی و غیره، به عنوان مثال به این دلیل که خیلی طولانی است یا ممکن است باعث آزار مردم شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The original version was cut by more than 30 minutes.","translation":"نسخه اصلی بیش از 30 دقیقه قطع شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778335.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('05c0b164-24f0-5056-9f9f-66f8d530fcfa','ab720744-90d8-50eb-883b-d3c60020c9f0',5,'make a hole/mark','حفره/علامت گذاشتن','spoken & written','to make a hole or mark in the surface of something, or to open it using a sharp tool','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'سوراخ کردن یا علامت گذاری روی سطح چیزی یا باز کردن آن با ابزار نوک تیز','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The blade cut deep into the wood.","translation":"تیغه به عمق چوب برید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778339.mp3"},{"sentence":"Strange letters had been cut into the stone.","translation":"حروف عجیب و غریبی در سنگ بریده شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778342.mp3"},{"sentence":"Cut a hole in the middle of the paper.","translation":"وسط کاغذ را سوراخ کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778343.mp3"},{"sentence":"Cut open the chillies and remove the seeds.","translation":"فلفل ها را باز کرده و دانه ها را جدا کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778346.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('4b12b1a3-c416-5ac2-9f95-ad281fbc4296','ab720744-90d8-50eb-883b-d3c60020c9f0',6,'injure','زخمی کردن','spoken & written','to injure yourself on something sharp that breaks the skin and makes you bleed','[ transitive ]',null,'آسیب زدن به خود بر روی چیزی تیز که پوست را می شکند و باعث خونریزی شما می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I noticed he’d cut his finger quite badly.","translation":"متوجه شدم انگشتش را خیلی بد بریده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001123226.mp3"},{"sentence":"Marcie said she’d cut herself on a broken glass.","translation":"مارسی گفت که خودش را روی یک شیشه شکسته بریده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001123229.mp3"},{"sentence":"That knife’s extremely sharp! Mind you don’t cut yourself.","translation":"آن چاقو بسیار تیز است! حواستون باشه خودتونو برش نداری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778354.mp3"},{"sentence":"On Eric’s chin was a scrap of cotton wool where he’d cut himself shaving .","translation":"روی چانه اریک تکه‌ای از پشم بود که در آنجا خودش را در حال تراشیدن می‌تراشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778355.mp3"},{"sentence":"She fell and cut her head open .","translation":"افتاد و سرش را باز کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778361.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('dfce4dff-c848-5ff5-979e-cfe337d85b8b','ab720744-90d8-50eb-883b-d3c60020c9f0',7,'make/form something by cutting','با بریدن چیزی ساختن/شکل دادن','spoken & written','to make or form something from a solid piece of wood, metal etc using a sharp tool','[ transitive ]',null,'ساختن یا شکل دادن چیزی از یک قطعه جامد چوب، فلز و غیره با استفاده از ابزار تیز','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ll get a spare key cut for you.","translation":"من یک کلید یدکی برای شما می گیرم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778372.mp3"},{"sentence":"The chair had been cut from the trunk of a tree.","translation":"صندلی از تنه درخت بریده شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778375.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('f72d342b-7873-5bed-b78d-43cfd8ad8cd6','ab720744-90d8-50eb-883b-d3c60020c9f0',8,'let somebody get free','بگذار کسی آزاد شود','spoken & written','to cut something such as metal or rope in order to let someone escape from where they are trapped','[ transitive ]',null,'بریدن چیزی مانند فلز یا طناب به منظور فرار کسی از جایی که به دام افتاده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She had to be cut from the wreckage of her car.","translation":"مجبور شد از لاشه ماشینش جدا شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778380.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was in the vehicle for an hour before he was cut free .","translation":"او یک ساعت در وسیله نقلیه بود تا اینکه آزاد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778381.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
