('76533b3a-53b8-50a4-b423-7610f18a93d3','a162b709-a97f-5db2-a020-0753a16b67df',1,'reduction','کاهش','spoken & written','a reduction in the size or amount of something, especially the amount of money that is spent by a government or company','[ usually plural ]',null,'کاهش در اندازه یا مقدار چیزی، به ویژه مقدار پولی که توسط یک دولت یا شرکت خرج می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make cuts The country needs to make cuts in the carbon dioxide it produces.','announce cuts A major engineering company has announced big job cuts.','take/accept cuts (= agree to have something reduced ) Some employees were forced to take pay cuts.','tax cuts The president announced tax cuts.','pay/wage cuts Millions of workers face pay cuts.','job/staff cuts There have been falling sales and job cuts at the newspaper.','spending cuts His proposals could involve spending cuts of up to £12 billion.','price cuts The company announced big price cuts on all its computers.','defence cuts Further proposals for defence cuts were drawn up.','deep/severe cuts (= big reductions ) Deep cuts were made in research spending.','drastic/sharp cuts (= big and sudden reductions ) He resigned over drastic cuts in the education budget.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There will be cuts across all levels of the company.","translation":"کاهش در تمام سطوح شرکت وجود خواهد داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778673.mp3"},{"sentence":"Cuts in public spending mean that fewer people can go on to higher education.","translation":"کاهش هزینه های عمومی به این معنی است که افراد کمتری می توانند به تحصیلات عالی بروند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001126219.mp3"},{"sentence":"The decision to make cuts in health care provision has been widely criticized.","translation":"تصمیم برای کاهش خدمات بهداشتی به طور گسترده مورد انتقاد قرار گرفته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778674.mp3"},{"sentence":"A shorter working week will mean pay cuts for millions of workers.","translation":"یک هفته کاری کوتاهتر به معنای کاهش دستمزد میلیون ها کارگر خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001126216.mp3"},{"sentence":"The building plans could be hit by possible spending cuts .","translation":"طرح های ساختمانی ممکن است با کاهش هزینه های احتمالی آسیب ببینند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778678.mp3"},{"sentence":"A cut of 1% in interest rates was announced yesterday.","translation":"دیروز کاهش یک درصدی نرخ بهره اعلام شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778684.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('6ef85aa5-3ebf-578f-93f1-ec5bc097bb24','a162b709-a97f-5db2-a020-0753a16b67df',2,'skin wound','زخم پوستی','spoken & written','a wound that is caused when something sharp cuts your skin',null,null,'زخمی که زمانی ایجاد می شود که چیزی تیز پوست شما را بریده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"That’s quite a nasty cut – you ought to get it seen to by a doctor.","translation":"این یک بریدگی بسیار ناخوشایند است - شما باید آن را توسط پزشک معاینه کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001126201.mp3"},{"sentence":"The driver escaped with minor cuts and bruises .","translation":"راننده با جراحات جزئی و کبودی فرار کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001778686.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
