('ac52bfd6-6946-5ecf-95ac-e60653248f3c','46aa5fb6-af67-5d84-9f8d-2f2ac9837c4f',1,'become dead','مرده شدن','spoken & written','to stop living and become dead',null,null,'مردن؛ خاموش شدن؛ حسرت (برای)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['die instantly (= as soon as an accident, injury etc happens ) He was shot in the head and died instantly.','die suddenly She died suddenly of a heart attack, in Amsterdam.','die young They had seven children and three of them died young.','die alone He had a fear of dying alone.','die unmarried He died unmarried in 1922.','die aged 35/50 etc Her father died aged 84.','die peacefully (= calmly and without pain ) The nurses said that she died very peacefully.','die tragically His wife had died tragically in an accident.','die penniless (= without any money ) Van Gogh died penniless because nobody bought his paintings.','die in your sleep During the night he died in his sleep.','die in suspicious/mysterious circumstances (= used to say that someone may have been killed ) He got involved with drug dealers and died in mysterious circumstances.','die a natural death (= of natural causes, rather than being killed ) The coroner concluded that Wilkins had died a natural death.','die a sudden/violent/slow etc death At the end of the play, the main character dies a violent death.','die a hero/rich man etc He died a hero on the battlefield.','die in childbirth (= giving birth to a baby ) More women died in childbirth in the past.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He died in 1985 at the age of 76.","translation":"او در سال 1985 در سن 76 سالگی درگذشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689958.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her father died suddenly in an accident when she was only ten.","translation":"پدرش زمانی که او تنها ده سال داشت به طور ناگهانی در یک تصادف فوت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689959.mp3"},{"sentence":"The animals died of starvation in the snow.","translation":"حیوانات از گرسنگی در برف مردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001141428.mp3"},{"sentence":"patients who are dying from cancer","translation":"بیمارانی که بر اثر سرطان در حال مرگ هستند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001141429.mp3"},{"sentence":"She died peacefully in her sleep at the age of 98.","translation":"او در سن 98 سالگی با آرامش در خواب درگذشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001141450.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do you believe in anything enough to die for it?","translation":"آیا به چیزی آنقدر اعتقاد داری که برای آن بمیری؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001141432.mp3"},{"sentence":"She died young, at the age of 27.","translation":"او در سن 27 سالگی در جوانی درگذشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001141435.mp3"},{"sentence":"The bullet went straight through his head, and he died instantly .","translation":"گلوله مستقیماً از سرش عبور کرد و بلافاصله مرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001962474.mp3"},{"sentence":"It must remain a secret until the day I die.","translation":"باید تا روز مرگم راز باقی بماند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689967.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was his dying wish that the house be opened to the public.","translation":"این آرزوی مرگبار او بود که خانه به روی عموم باز شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689971.mp3"},{"sentence":"My uncle died a hero.","translation":"دایی من قهرمان مرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001962480.mp3"},{"sentence":"Did she die a natural death? (= did she die naturally, or did someone kill her? )","translation":"آیا او به مرگ طبیعی مرد؟ (= آیا او به طور طبیعی مرد، یا کسی او را کشت؟)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001962483.mp3"},{"sentence":"He died of a heart attack.","translation":"او بر اثر سکته قلبی درگذشت.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"He died from a heart attack.","translation":"او بر اثر سکته قلبی درگذشت.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"He died in a car crash.","translation":"او در یک تصادف رانندگی جان باخت.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"These men died for our freedom.","translation":"این مردان برای آزادی ما مردند.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,16),
('94579002-e393-50c8-b67e-21b1a9b89558','46aa5fb6-af67-5d84-9f8d-2f2ac9837c4f',2,'disappear','ناپدید می شوند','spoken & written','to disappear or stop existing',null,null,'ناپدید شدن یا توقف وجود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['die instantly (= as soon as an accident, injury etc happens ) He was shot in the head and died instantly.','die suddenly She died suddenly of a heart attack, in Amsterdam.','die young They had seven children and three of them died young.','die alone He had a fear of dying alone.','die unmarried He died unmarried in 1922.','die aged 35/50 etc Her father died aged 84.','die peacefully (= calmly and without pain ) The nurses said that she died very peacefully.','die tragically His wife had died tragically in an accident.','die penniless (= without any money ) Van Gogh died penniless because nobody bought his paintings.','die in your sleep During the night he died in his sleep.','die in suspicious/mysterious circumstances (= used to say that someone may have been killed ) He got involved with drug dealers and died in mysterious circumstances.','die a natural death (= of natural causes, rather than being killed ) The coroner concluded that Wilkins had died a natural death.','die a sudden/violent/slow etc death At the end of the play, the main character dies a violent death.','die a hero/rich man etc He died a hero on the battlefield.','die in childbirth (= giving birth to a baby ) More women died in childbirth in the past.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Our love will never die.","translation":"عشق ما هرگز نخواهد مرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001141456.mp3"},{"sentence":"The family name will die with him (= disappear when he dies ) .","translation":"نام خانوادگي با او خواهد مرد (= هنگام مرگ او ناپديد مي شود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001141460.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s one of a dying breed (= a type of person that is no longer common ) .","translation":"او یکی از نژادهای در حال مرگ است (= نوعی از افراد که دیگر رایج نیستند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689973.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
