('8bbdab19-e5f6-5220-a583-339e93194d64','d4ed7611-b883-51a1-b8aa-f4d2a0833dc7',1,'not wet','خیس نیست','spoken & written','without water or liquid inside or on the surface',null,'bone dry','خشک، بی‌آب؛ کم‌حوصله (خشک)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['dry grass There had been no rain and the grass was very dry.','dry clothes I had no dry clothes to change into.','dry land (= not the sea ) It was good to get off the ship onto dry land again.','dry ingredients (= the things in a recipe that are not liquid ) Add the eggs and milk to the dry ingredients.','keep dry We managed to keep dry inside an old farm building.','get dry (= become dry ) Come inside and get dry.','shake/rub/wipe etc something dry He wiped his hands dry with a handkerchief.','towel something dry (= use a towel to dry something ) Towel your hair dry before using a hairdryer.','dry as a bone/bone dry (= completely dry ) These plants need some water – they’re dry as a bone.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I need to change into some dry clothes .","translation":"من باید چند لباس خشک عوض کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001163742.mp3"},{"sentence":"Make sure that the surface is clean and dry before you start to paint.","translation":"قبل از شروع رنگ آمیزی از تمیز و خشک بودن سطح آن اطمینان حاصل کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001163743.mp3"},{"sentence":"You should store disks in a cool, dry place.","translation":"باید دیسک ها را در جای خشک و خنک نگهداری کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001163744.mp3"},{"sentence":"Jean rubbed her hair dry.","translation":"ژان موهایش را خشک کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001163747.mp3"},{"sentence":"The path is dry as a bone (= very dry ) .","translation":"راه خشک است مانند استخوان (= بسیار خشک) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001707118.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
