open.','have/keep etc your eyes glued to something (= be watching something with all your attention ) Ted sat with his eyes glued to the television.','somebody’s eyes are full of tears When she put the phone down, her eyes were full of tears.','somebody’s eyes are full of hatred/fear etc The prisoners stared at him, their eyes full of hatred.','an eye test ( also an eye exam American English ) (= to find out how well you can see ) You should have an eye test every couple of years.','eye make-up (= make-up that you put on your eyelids or eyelashes ) She never leaves the house without lipstick and eye make-up.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Go through your shopping list with a critical eye for foods with a high fat content.","translation":"فهرست خرید خود را با نگاهی انتقادی به غذاهایی با محتوای چربی بالا مرور کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001780706.mp3"},{"sentence":"The magazine combines the accuracy of the scientist with the eye of the artist.","translation":"این مجله دقت دانشمند را با چشم هنرمند ترکیب می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001780712.mp3"},{"sentence":"The picture quality, to my eye, is excellent.","translation":"کیفیت تصویر به نظر من عالی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001780715.mp3"},{"sentence":"The story is told through the eyes of a refugee child.","translation":"داستان از نگاه یک کودک پناهنده روایت می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001780719.mp3"},{"sentence":"Carl could do no wrong in the eyes of his parents.","translation":"کارل از نظر والدینش هیچ غلطی نمی توانست بکند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001780723.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
