('9eeb536b-e78f-5f6c-9a02-1470f483cd4b','2a5dd7fb-4c22-5a55-9f8d-b174674b8ebc',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to look at someone or something carefully, especially because you do not trust them or because you want something',null,null,'با دقت به کسی یا چیزی نگاه کنید، مخصوصاً به این دلیل که به آنها اعتماد ندارید یا چیزی را می خواهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The man behind the desk eyed us suspiciously.","translation":"مرد پشت میز مشکوک به ما نگاه کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001521666.mp3"},{"sentence":"A crowd of local children gathered around, eying us in silence.","translation":"جمعیتی از بچه های محل دور هم جمع شدند و در سکوت به ما چشم دوختند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001521667.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('e49e2306-c236-5320-ac79-68942d9c1009','a6170fc9-6906-51c5-82d9-4fcca8bcac9d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who likes a particular sport or performing art very much, or who admires a famous person',null,null,'هوادار، طرفدار؛ پنکه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a football/tennis/baseball etc fan Jack is a keen football fan.','a music/jazz/rock etc fan Jazz fans are in for a treat at this year’s Montreux Jazz Festival.','a film/movie fan This book is a must for all film fans.','a Manchester United/Redsox/Colts etc fan Manchester United fans were delighted with their team’s victory.','a Rolling Stones/Kylie Minogue etc fan Mike has been a lifelong Kylie Minogue fan.','a big/huge/massive fan Elizabeth is a massive fan of Elton John.','a devoted fan (= a strong supporter or admirer ) Devoted fans from all over the country have travelled to the concert.','a loyal fan (= fans who always support someone ) He will be playing to hundreds of loyal fans on Sunday.','adoring fans (= fans who like and admire someone very much ) She’s mobbed by adoring fans wherever she goes.','somebody’s number one fan She told Dave that she was his number one fan.','rival/opposing/opposition fans (= fans who support different teams competing against each other ) There were fights between rival fans outside the stadium.','home fans (= fans at their own team’s sports field ) The home fans cheered the team onto the pitch.','away fans (= fans visiting another team’s sports field ) Two sections of the ground had been allocated to away fans.','fan mail The group receives lots of fan mail.','a fan club Her fan club has 25,000 members in the UK alone.','fan base (= the people who are someone’s biggest fans ) The band has built up a loyal fan base over the years.','fans cheer/applaud (somebody/something) Fans on both sides applauded their skill and spirit.','fans boo (somebody/something) Their own fans booed them off the pitch.','fans chant something England fans chanted his name.','disappoint fans The concert was cancelled, disappointing hundreds of fans.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Groups of football fans began heading towards the ground.","translation":"گروهی از هواداران فوتبال شروع به حرکت به سمت زمین کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000561.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s a big fan of Elvis Presley.","translation":"او یکی از طرفداران بزرگ الویس پریسلی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001647973.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('847b4901-bc75-5191-ba77-e447f48b67e8','a6170fc9-6906-51c5-82d9-4fcca8bcac9d',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a machine with turning blades that is used to cool the air in a room by moving it around',null,null,'دستگاهی با تیغه های چرخشی که برای خنک کردن هوای اتاق با حرکت دادن آن به اطراف استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a football/tennis/baseball etc fan Jack is a keen football fan.','a music/jazz/rock etc fan Jazz fans are in for a treat at this year’s Montreux Jazz Festival.','a film/movie fan This book is a must for all film fans.','a Manchester United/Redsox/Colts etc fan Manchester United fans were delighted with their team’s victory.','a Rolling Stones/Kylie Minogue etc fan Mike has been a lifelong Kylie Minogue fan.','a big/huge/massive fan Elizabeth is a massive fan of Elton John.','a devoted fan (= a strong supporter or admirer ) Devoted fans from all over the country have travelled to the concert.','a loyal fan (= fans who always support someone ) He will be playing to hundreds of loyal fans on Sunday.','adoring fans (= fans who like and admire someone very much ) She’s mobbed by adoring fans wherever she goes.','somebody’s number one fan She told Dave that she was his number one fan.','rival/opposing/opposition fans (= fans who support different teams competing against each other ) There were fights between rival fans outside the stadium.','home fans (= fans at their own team’s sports field ) The home fans cheered the team onto the pitch.','away fans (= fans visiting another team’s sports field ) Two sections of the ground had been allocated to away fans.','fan mail The group receives lots of fan mail.','a fan club Her fan club has 25,000 members in the UK alone.','fan base (= the people who are someone’s biggest fans ) The band has built up a loyal fan base over the years.','fans cheer/applaud (somebody/something) Fans on both sides applauded their skill and spirit.','fans boo (somebody/something) Their own fans booed them off the pitch.','fans chant something England fans chanted his name.','disappoint fans The concert was cancelled, disappointing hundreds of fans.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a ceiling fan","translation":"یک پنکه سقفی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001211410.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('a9f2cb11-5c56-5a1a-b1e0-ee6511226d7c','0fd7ff6d-1abe-569e-9252-ef947f015b98',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to make air move around by waving a fan, piece of paper etc so that you feel cooler',null,null,'برای حرکت دادن هوا با تکان دادن فن، تکه کاغذ و غیره به طوری که احساس خنکی کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"People in the audience were fanning themselves with their programmes.","translation":"تماشاگران با برنامه های خود هوادار خود بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001211428.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('5bd4c7bb-76de-57d8-be62-b25aec8a45f0','0fd7ff6d-1abe-569e-9252-ef947f015b98',2,null,null,'literary','to make someone feel an emotion more strongly',null,null,'برای وادار کردن کسی به احساس قوی تر',array['fuel']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her resistance only fanned his desire.","translation":"مقاومت او فقط میل او را تقویت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001211432.mp3"},{"sentence":"The book will serve to fan the flames of debate.","translation":"این کتاب برای شعله ور کردن آتش بحث ها مفید خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001647986.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
