('f191f9f1-977b-5fbc-80ce-cc9b3c7c3768','831014ab-04ef-57bc-969c-4dc59f88c316',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an amount of money that you pay to do something or that you pay to a professional person for their work',null,null,'بها، حق‌الزحمه؛ حق عضویت (ورودی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['small/low Some companies will sell the items for you, for a small fee.','high/large/big The school fees are extremely high.','a hefty/fat fee informal (= a very large fee ) Customers are being charged a hefty fee for their telephone service.','an annual/a monthly fee An annual fee of £150 has been introduced.','an entrance/entry fee (= a fee to enter a place ) The gallery charges an entrance fee.','a membership fee (= a fee to become a member of a club or organization ) The gym’s yearly membership fee is £250.','a subscription fee (= a fee to receive copies of a newspaper or magazine ) You can pay the subscription fee by cheque.','school/college/university fees She paid for her college fees by taking a part-time job as a waitress.','tuition fees (= money paid for being taught ) Many universities now charge tuition fees for these courses.','doctor’s/lawyer’s/accountant’s etc fees We need to find the money for the doctor’s fees somehow.','legal/medical fees She received £300 compensation after legal fees had been deducted.','a flat/fixed/set fee (= a fee that is the same in every case ) You pay a flat fee for all the services that are provided.','a booking fee ( also a service fee American English ) (= a charge you pay when buying a ticket ) Tickets for the concert are £45, plus a booking fee.','a cancellation fee (= a charge for ending an agreement you have made to travel on a train, stay at a hotel etc ) A 10% cancellation fee will be charged if the booking is cancelled.','a licence fee British English (= the money a television licence costs ) The licence fee is set to rise again.','charge a fee The accountant charged a big fee for his services.','pay a fee You have to pay a small fee to rent a locker.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"You can use the gym and pool for a fee of £35 a month.","translation":"می توانید با پرداخت 35 پوند در ماه از باشگاه و استخر استفاده کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000567.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('9b467e0a-1be4-5f10-a3cd-d18f5ac12267','1d0958ce-a4c7-5913-8537-b81168cecaa4',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a small number of things or people','[ no comparative ]',null,'کم (تعداد اندک)؛ چند (منفی: هیچ‌چیز)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I have to buy a few things at the supermarket.","translation":"باید از سوپرمارکت چند چیز بخرم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001246350.mp3"},{"sentence":"Pam called to say she’s going to be a few minutes late.","translation":"پام زنگ زد و گفت که چند دقیقه دیر خواهد آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001246361.mp3"},{"sentence":"There were a few people sitting at the back of the hall.","translation":"چند نفر پشت سالن نشسته بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001246365.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are a few more things I’d like to discuss.","translation":"چند مورد دیگر وجود دارد که می خواهم در مورد آنها صحبت کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001246358.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve read a few of her books.","translation":"من چند تا از کتاب هایش را خوانده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001246355.mp3"},{"sentence":"I could suggest many different methods, but anyway, here are just a few .","translation":"من می‌توانم روش‌های مختلفی را پیشنهاد کنم، اما به هر حال، در اینجا فقط چند مورد وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821924.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are only a very few (= not many ) exceptions.","translation":"فقط تعداد بسیار کمی (= نه زیاد) استثنا وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001682991.mp3"},{"sentence":"The office has been closed for the last few days.","translation":"این دفتر در چند روز اخیر تعطیل بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821931.mp3"},{"sentence":"The plants need to be watered every few days.","translation":"گیاهان باید هر چند روز یکبار آبیاری شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821934.mp3"},{"sentence":"She had enjoyed her few days in Monaco.","translation":"او از چند روز اقامت در موناکو لذت برده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821937.mp3"}]'::jsonb,10),
('18f48216-47e7-5699-9b2b-1b07baa67363','1d0958ce-a4c7-5913-8537-b81168cecaa4',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'quite a few/a good few/not a few','کم (تعداد اندک)؛ چند (منفی: هیچ‌چیز)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
