('fa6fd206-81a8-5783-b0ef-539ba3658209','3154f912-bfa2-5448-a8fb-6a0f7f0ed550',1,null,null,'spoken & written','enjoyable and amusing',null,null,'خوش‌گذران، بامزه؛ خوش‌آمد (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Try snowboarding – it’s a really fun sport.","translation":"اسنوبورد را امتحان کنید - این یک ورزش واقعا سرگرم کننده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001705340.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('11e1de78-c4c5-5ecc-aded-d0d733840fc4','3154f912-bfa2-5448-a8fb-6a0f7f0ed550',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a fun person is enjoyable to be with because they are happy and amusing',null,null,'بودن با یک فرد سرگرم کننده لذت بخش است زیرا آنها شاد و سرگرم کننده هستند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She’s a really fun person to be around.","translation":"او یک فرد واقعاً سرگرم کننده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001314531.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('269ef7d6-e197-56c6-a566-c54afa45c259','4ba24c54-ea75-5109-a8a0-8bdcccf00b1d',1,'a space','یک فضا','spoken & written','a space between two objects or two parts of an object, especially because something is missing',null,null,'شکاف، حاشیه؛ خلأ (بازار)؛ فاصله (سنی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The neighbors’ dog got in through a gap in the hedge.","translation":"سگ همسایه از شکافی در پرچین وارد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001320870.mp3"},{"sentence":"a gap in the traffic","translation":"شکاف در ترافیک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001697972.mp3"},{"sentence":"the gap between the two rows of seats","translation":"فاصله بین دو ردیف صندلی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001320873.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('74359a9d-886a-5bc5-b34c-d5d93992bdb9','4ba24c54-ea75-5109-a8a0-8bdcccf00b1d',2,'difference','تفاوت','spoken & written','a big difference between two situations, amounts , groups of people etc',null,'generation gap','تفاوت بزرگ بین دو موقعیت، مقدار، گروه افراد و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a big/large/wide gap There’s a big gap between the two test scores.','a huge/substantial etc gap A huge gap exists between the life styles of the rich and the poor.','a narrow gap There’s only a narrow gap between the two candidates in the polls.','a yawning gap (= a very big difference ) There’s a yawning gap between the earnings of men and women.','a growing/widening gap There is a widening gap in the academic performance of boys and girls.','an unbridgeable gap (= a gap that cannot be closed ) He felt that there was an unbridgeable gap between the negotiating positions of the two sides.','a trade gap (= the difference between the amount a country imports and exports ) Britain’s trade gap almost doubled last month.','the gender gap (= the difference between men and women ) The gender gap was visible in the way men and women voted during the presidential elections.','the generation gap (= the difference in attitudes, tastes etc between older and younger people ) Taste in music is a good indicator of the generation gap.','an age gap (= a difference in age between two people ) Despite the age gap, they became good friends.','a cultural gap (= a difference between cultures ) There is a cultural gap between Europe and America on this subject.','bridge/close/narrow the gap (= reduce the amount or importance of a difference ) The book aims to bridge the gap between theory and practice. The policies are designed to close the gap between rich and poor.','the gap narrows Polls show the gap between the two candidates has narrowed.','widen the gap Technology has widened the gap between people with and without computer skills.','the gap widens The gap is widening between the incomes of the rich and the less well-off.','a gap exists A cultural gap exists between the older and the younger generations.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the widening gap between the rich and the poor","translation":"شکاف بین فقیر و غنی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001320880.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('3b3ced45-027e-5559-b6cb-f4f515ab2567','4ba24c54-ea75-5109-a8a0-8bdcccf00b1d',3,'something missing','چیزی گم شده','spoken & written','something missing that stops something else from being good or complete',null,null,'چیزی از دست رفته که چیز دیگری را از خوب یا کامل بودن باز می دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"There are huge gaps in my knowledge of history.","translation":"شکاف های بزرگی در دانش من از تاریخ وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001320899.mp3"},{"sentence":"Frank’s death has left a big gap in my life.","translation":"مرگ فرانک یک شکاف بزرگ در زندگی من ایجاد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001320900.mp3"},{"sentence":"He filled the gap left by Hirst’s retirement.","translation":"او جای خالی بازنشستگی هیرس را پر کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001320883.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('de8d3bda-b407-5aa6-91d3-d05a80168a91','4ba24c54-ea75-5109-a8a0-8bdcccf00b1d',4,'in time','در زمان','spoken & written','a period of time when nothing is happening, that exists between two other periods of time when something is happening',null,'gap year','یک دوره زمانی که هیچ اتفاقی نمی افتد، که بین دو دوره زمانی دیگر وجود دارد که چیزی در حال وقوع است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"an awkward gap in the conversation","translation":"یک شکاف ناخوشایند در مکالمه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001320910.mp3"},{"sentence":"The gaps between his visits got longer and longer.","translation":"فاصله بین دیدارهای او طولانی تر و طولانی تر شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001697984.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
