 used ) Household gas bills have increased dramatically.','gas production The company expanded its gas production facilities.','the gas industry There are plans to nationalize the country''s gas industry.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Can you light the gas for me?","translation":"میشه گاز رو برام روشن کنی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001521841.mp3"},{"sentence":"The explosion was caused by a gas leak from the water heater.","translation":"این انفجار ناشی از نشت گاز از آبگرمکن بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001711142.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
