('a7509e45-0a24-516d-8031-35f9853f250d','79e910dc-ffbb-5c34-825a-aec3ae444374',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if something hots up, there is more activity or excitement',null,'hot up','اگر چیزی داغ شود، فعالیت یا هیجان بیشتری وجود دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Things generally hot up a few days before the race.","translation":"به طور کلی اوضاع چند روز قبل از مسابقه داغ می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001362110.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('241dc7b2-71d2-56d9-96c7-7049d12cdc71','66a6cbe6-ee95-552f-b60f-536583bcba7e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to ask or talk about the way in which something happens or is done',null,null,'چگونه، چطور؛ چند (مقدار)؛ چقدر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"How do you spell your name?","translation":"اسمت رو چطور مینویسی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709155.mp3"},{"sentence":"How can I help you?","translation":"چگونه می توانم به شما کمک کنم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709156.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’d like to help in some way, but I’m not sure how.","translation":"من می خواهم به نوعی کمک کنم، اما مطمئن نیستم که چگونه.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709171.mp3"},{"sentence":"He explained how the system worked.","translation":"او نحوه عملکرد سیستم را توضیح داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709172.mp3"},{"sentence":"We both used to work at the airport – that’s how we met.","translation":"هر دوی ما قبلاً در فرودگاه کار می کردیم - اینگونه بود که ملاقات کردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709174.mp3"},{"sentence":"I don’t know how to get to your house.","translation":"من نمی دانم چگونه به خانه شما برسم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000803.mp3"},{"sentence":"Alan showed me how to load the gun.","translation":"آلن به من نشان داد که چگونه اسلحه را پر کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709166.mp3"},{"sentence":"advice on how best (= the best way ) to invest your money","translation":"مشاوره در مورد بهترین (= بهترین راه) برای سرمایه گذاری پول خود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000804.mp3"},{"sentence":"They had a number of suggestions as to how the service could be improved.","translation":"آنها تعدادی پیشنهاد در مورد چگونگی بهبود خدمات داشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709175.mp3"},{"sentence":"This still leaves the question of how local services should be funded.","translation":"این هنوز این سوال را ایجاد می کند که خدمات محلی چگونه باید تامین شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709179.mp3"},{"sentence":"How on earth did you find out?","translation":"از کجا فهمیدی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001814028.mp3"}]'::jsonb,11),
('ffad23f4-86a6-5a5d-96a4-a125e19bfa53','66a6cbe6-ee95-552f-b60f-536583bcba7e',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used to ask or talk about the amount , size , degree etc of something',null,null,'برای پرسیدن یا صحبت در مورد مقدار، اندازه، درجه و غیره چیزی استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"How big is the state of Louisiana?","translation":"ایالت لوئیزیانا چقدر بزرگ است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001363733.mp3"},{"sentence":"How many kids do they have now?","translation":"الان چند تا بچه دارن؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001363734.mp3"},{"sentence":"How long have you been learning English?","translation":"چه مدت است که انگلیسی یاد می گیرید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001363735.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do you know how old it is?","translation":"میدونی چند سالشه؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709186.mp3"},{"sentence":"They couldn’t tell exactly how far away the bridge was.","translation":"آنها نمی توانستند دقیقا بگویند که پل چقدر دور است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709187.mp3"},{"sentence":"She wondered how much Angela already knew.","translation":"او تعجب کرد که آنجلا از قبل چقدر می دانست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000805.mp3"},{"sentence":"How much are the tickets?","translation":"بلیط ها چنده؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001814029.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('90ba6067-77e1-52ae-b163-89c816ec27c1','66a6cbe6-ee95-552f-b60f-536583bcba7e',3,null,null,'spoken','used to ask about someone’s health , especially when you meet them',null,null,'در مورد سلامتی کسی سوال می‌پرسید، مخصوصاً وقتی با او ملاقات می‌کردید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘Hi Laurie, how are you?’ ‘Fine, thanks. How are you?’","translation":"«سلام لوری، چطوری؟» «خوب، ممنون. چطوری؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001363765.mp3"},{"sentence":"Has Ros had the baby yet? How is she?","translation":"آیا راس هنوز بچه دار شده است؟ او چطور است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000806.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘How’s your ankle this morning?’ ‘Better, thanks.’","translation":"«امروز صبح مچ پایت چطور است؟» «بهتر است، ممنون.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001363743.mp3"},{"sentence":"So how’s it going at work these days? Still enjoying it?","translation":"پس این روزها در محل کار چگونه است؟ هنوز از آن لذت می برید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001363775.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘ How are things with you?’ ‘Fine.’","translation":"«حالت با تو چطور است؟» «خوب است.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001814037.mp3"},{"sentence":"How are you doing ?","translation":"حال شما چطور است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001814041.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('4820d1f0-7338-5202-974e-41b3ff5e97fe','66a6cbe6-ee95-552f-b60f-536583bcba7e',4,null,null,'spoken & written','used to ask someone about their opinion or experience of something',null,null,'از کسی در مورد نظر یا تجربه اش درباره چیزی می پرسید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"How was the film?","translation":"فیلم چطور بود؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709203.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘How’s your steak?’ ‘Mmm, it’s good.’","translation":"\"استیک شما چطور است؟\" \"مم، خوب است.\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709204.mp3"},{"sentence":"How did your exams go?","translation":"امتحاناتت چطور گذشت؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709205.mp3"},{"sentence":"How do you feel about seeing Peter again?","translation":"از دیدن دوباره پیتر چه احساسی داری؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709206.mp3"},{"sentence":"How’s that? Does that feel comfortable?","translation":"چطور؟ آیا این احساس راحتی دارد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709214.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('9bcd6112-9c76-5861-9439-650bbfbfac23','66a6cbe6-ee95-552f-b60f-536583bcba7e',5,null,null,'spoken & written','used after certain adjectives or verbs to refer to an event or situation',null,null,'بعد از صفت ها یا افعال خاص برای اشاره به یک رویداد یا موقعیت استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s amazing how they’ve managed to get everything finished so quickly.","translation":"شگفت انگیز است که چگونه آنها توانسته اند همه چیز را به این سرعت به پایان برسانند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709219.mp3"},{"sentence":"I remember how she always used to have fresh flowers in the house.","translation":"یادم می آید که او همیشه در خانه گل های تازه داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709220.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('554cf43c-8b28-5e71-93ff-0e13fbdedb1d','66a6cbe6-ee95-552f-b60f-536583bcba7e',6,null,null,'spoken & written','used to emphasize the quality you are mentioning','[ +adj/adverb ]',null,'برای تأکید بر کیفیتی که ذکر می کنید استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"How lovely to see you!","translation":"چقدر دیدنت دوست داشتنی!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709221.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘John’s been in an accident.’ ‘Oh, how awful!’","translation":"\"جان تصادف کرده است.\" \"اوه، چقدر وحشتناک!\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001363759.mp3"},{"sentence":"I didn’t realize how difficult it was to get tickets.","translation":"من متوجه نشدم که گرفتن بلیط چقدر سخت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001363760.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was impressed at how well she could read.","translation":"او از اینکه چقدر خوب می تواند بخواند تحت تأثیر قرار گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001363758.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('5ea880a1-2c8f-526f-a844-dd5e8a9e6fc4','66a6cbe6-ee95-552f-b60f-536583bcba7e',7,null,null,'old-fashioned','used to say that something happens to a very great degree',null,null,'می گفت که یک اتفاق به درجه بسیار بالایی می افتد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"How the crowd loved it!","translation":"چقدر جمعیت آن را دوست داشتند!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001814049.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
