('f708afbb-738d-572f-8910-3e97c75cfcd6','11859d91-696a-5138-8f9e-f1f88e9a792a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','great happiness and pleasure','[ uncountable ]',null,'شادی، خوشی، شگون','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be filled with joy/be full of joy I was full of joy at the thought of seeing her again.','tears of joy She began to cry again, but they were tears of joy.','a feeling of joy A feeling of total joy swept over him.','a sense of joy I’ll never forget the sense of joy that day.','a look of joy There was a look of joy on their faces.','shouts/cries of joy They greeted each other with cries of joy.','great joy To her great joy, she became the mother of two beautiful baby girls.','pure/sheer/complete joy (= a lot of joy, not mixed with other feelings ) It was a moment of pure joy.','overwhelming joy formal (= very great joy ) She experienced a feeling of overwhelming joy.','true/real joy How can I find true joy in life?','bring joy to somebody (= make someone feel joy ) Her children have brought her great joy.','give (somebody) joy His music has given people a lot of joy over the years.','feel/experience joy He had never felt the joy of watching the seasons come and go.','be jumping for joy (= be very pleased about something ) She tried to stay calm, but she was secretly jumping for joy.','express your joy (= show it ) They expressed their joy by jumping up and down and hugging each other.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the look of joy on her face","translation":"ظاهر شادی در چهره او","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001730261.mp3"},{"sentence":"I leaped into the air with joy.","translation":"با خوشحالی به هوا پریدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001730264.mp3"},{"sentence":"She wept for joy.","translation":"از خوشحالی گریه کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001730265.mp3"},{"sentence":"I didn’t exactly jump for joy (= I was not very pleased ) when I heard the news.","translation":"من دقیقاً از خوشحالی نپریدم (= خیلی راضی نبودم) وقتی خبر را شنیدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001730266.mp3"},{"sentence":"Thank you for your letter. I was really pleased to get it.","translation":"از نامه شما متشکرم. من واقعا از دریافت آن راضی بودم.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
('6c939936-44a0-57e3-aac4-1dff7d681452','11859d91-696a-5138-8f9e-f1f88e9a792a',2,null,null,'spoken & written','something or someone that gives you happiness and pleasure','[ countable ]',null,'چیزی یا کسی که به شما شادی و لذت می بخشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be filled with joy/be full of joy I was full of joy at the thought of seeing her again.','tears of joy She began to cry again, but they were tears of joy.','a feeling of joy A feeling of total joy swept over him.','a sense of joy I’ll never forget the sense of joy that day.','a look of joy There was a look of joy on their faces.','shouts/cries of joy They greeted each other with cries of joy.','great joy To her great joy, she became the mother of two beautiful baby girls.','pure/sheer/complete joy (= a lot of joy, not mixed with other feelings ) It was a moment of pure joy.','overwhelming joy formal (= very great joy ) She experienced a feeling of overwhelming joy.','true/real joy How can I find true joy in life?','bring joy to somebody (= make someone feel joy ) Her children have brought her great joy.','give (somebody) joy His music has given people a lot of joy over the years.','feel/experience joy He had never felt the joy of watching the seasons come and go.','be jumping for joy (= be very pleased about something ) She tried to stay calm, but she was secretly jumping for joy.','express your joy (= show it ) They expressed their joy by jumping up and down and hugging each other.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"one of the joys of travelling alone","translation":"یکی از لذت های تنهایی سفر کردن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001730273.mp3"},{"sentence":"The garden was his pride and joy .","translation":"باغ مایه افتخار و شادی او بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001730274.mp3"},{"sentence":"The children’s singing was a joy to listen to.","translation":"آواز خواندن بچه ها لذت بخش بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001730280.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('5f7d2a71-c5d8-5510-85eb-a4b8d2737f1c','11859d91-696a-5138-8f9e-f1f88e9a792a',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'no joy','شادی، خوشی، شگون','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be filled with joy/be full of joy I was full of joy at the thought of seeing her again.','tears of joy She began to cry again, but they were tears of joy.','a feeling of joy A feeling of total joy swept over him.','a sense of joy I’ll never forget the sense of joy that day.','a look of joy There was a look of joy on their faces.','shouts/cries of joy They greeted each other with cries of joy.','great joy To her great joy, she became the mother of two beautiful baby girls.','pure/sheer/complete joy (= a lot of joy, not mixed with other feelings ) It was a moment of pure joy.','overwhelming joy formal (= very great joy ) She experienced a feeling of overwhelming joy.','true/real joy How can I find true joy in life?','bring joy to somebody (= make someone feel joy ) Her children have brought her great joy.','give (somebody) joy His music has given people a lot of joy over the years.','feel/experience joy He had never felt the joy of watching the seasons come and go.','be jumping for joy (= be very pleased about something ) She tried to stay calm, but she was secretly jumping for joy.','express your joy (= show it ) They expressed their joy by jumping up and down and hugging each other.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
