('44316aa5-c579-556f-9edb-462aee291417','2207a09d-c52b-5920-bfa1-88dc0ed2e2c1',1,null,null,'spoken','used when speaking to an adult male, especially when you are excited , angry etc',null,null,'هنگام صحبت با یک مرد بالغ، به خصوص زمانی که هیجان زده، عصبانی و غیره هستید استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Stop talking nonsense, man!","translation":"دست از چرندیات بردار مرد!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000181183.mp3"},{"sentence":"You look great, man!","translation":"تو عالی به نظر میرسی، مرد!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000181190.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('55863de4-84d1-57a7-8c89-63c7cbee9956','3efece6f-28f8-53ca-8ed8-eebbf2b8155b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to work at, use, or operate a system, piece of equipment etc',null,null,'برای کار، استفاده، یا راه اندازی یک سیستم، قطعه ای از تجهیزات و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A team of volunteers are manning the phones.","translation":"تیمی از داوطلبان در حال نگهداری تلفن ها هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000181429.mp3"},{"sentence":"the first manned spacecraft","translation":"اولین فضاپیمای سرنشین دار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000181430.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ca5f55f6-ab22-535c-b5b8-fc6098ee7a17','218d6262-d3ce-566b-bab2-3b43ca10b0af',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to emphasize what you are saying, especially when you are angry, surprised , disappointed etc',null,null,'برای تأکید بر آنچه می گویید استفاده می شود، به خصوص زمانی که عصبانی، متعجب، ناامید و غیره هستید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Man, that was a lucky escape!","translation":"مرد، این یک فرار خوش شانس بود!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000181441.mp3"},{"sentence":"Oh, man ! I can hear the bullets.","translation":"آه، مرد! صدای گلوله ها را می شنوم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001533832.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b76d4ee4-01ee-5851-bf29-b0d40c646c9a','200fbac7-adb1-5cf6-a821-2393118ccd74',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a drawing of a particular area, for example a city or country, which shows its main features , such as its roads, rivers , mountains etc',null,null,'نقشه، اطلس؛ نقشه (شکاف)؛ نقشه (ماده)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['look at a map She stopped the car to look at the map.','read a map (= look at and understand the information on a map ) He drove while I read the map.','study a map (= look carefully at a map ) They studied the map before setting out.','draw a map He drew me a map of the route.','check a map ( also consult a map formal ) (= look at a map to get information ) I don''t know how to get to Berlin without consulting a map.','be marked on a map (= put a mark or symbol on a map to show where something is ) The path is clearly marked on the map.','find something on a map I managed to find the village on the map.','spread out/unfold a map We spread out our maps on the floor.','detailed a detailed map of the city','accurate a modern, accurate map of the district','large-scale (= showing a small area in a lot of detail ) a large-scale map of Paris','a road map a road map of Texas','a street map There''s a street map outside the town hall.','a tourist map The museum is marked on most tourist maps.','an Ordnance Survey map British English (= a map showing the roads, paths, hills etc of an area in detail )','the contours on a map (= the lines on a map showing the height of mountains and valleys ) Contours on the map are given in feet.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a map of Mexico City","translation":"نقشه مکزیکو سیتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001000.mp3"},{"sentence":"According to the map we should turn left.","translation":"طبق نقشه باید به چپ بپیچیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000184368.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m just trying to find Vancouver on the map.","translation":"من فقط سعی می کنم ونکوور را روی نقشه پیدا کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001752049.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('f7ac90b4-8418-52d6-9197-b4a8fe767b73','200fbac7-adb1-5cf6-a821-2393118ccd74',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a drawing of an area showing some kind of special feature, for example the type of rocks , weather , population etc',null,null,'نقاشی یک منطقه که نوعی ویژگی خاص را نشان می دهد، به عنوان مثال نوع سنگ ها، آب و هوا، جمعیت و غیره',array['chart']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['look at a map She stopped the car to look at the map.','read a map (= look at and understand the information on a map ) He drove while I read the map.','study a map (= look carefully at a map ) They studied the map before setting out.','draw a map He drew me a map of the route.','check a map ( also consult a map formal ) (= look at a map to get information ) I don''t know how to get to Berlin without consulting a map.','be marked on a map (= put a mark or symbol on a map to show where something is ) The path is clearly marked on the map.','find something on a map I managed to find the village on the map.','spread out/unfold a map We spread out our maps on the floor.','detailed a detailed map of the city','accurate a modern, accurate map of the district','large-scale (= showing a small area in a lot of detail ) a large-scale map of Paris','a road map a road map of Texas','a street map There''s a street map outside the town hall.','a tourist map The museum is marked on most tourist maps.','an Ordnance Survey map British English (= a map showing the roads, paths, hills etc of an area in detail )','the contours on a map (= the lines on a map showing the height of mountains and valleys ) Contours on the map are given in feet.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"an archaeological map of the area","translation":"نقشه باستان شناسی منطقه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001752057.mp3"},{"sentence":"the colour weather map in the newspaper","translation":"نقشه رنگی آب و هوا در روزنامه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001817262.mp3"}]'::jsonb