('723300a2-e1d4-5bb9-b54c-36143c1584e6','e6d8ca6b-9772-51dc-a94b-498cb4f0ecf1',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to kill someone',null,null,'برای کشتن کسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The guy who did this ought to be offed.","translation":"مردی که این کار را انجام داده است، باید توهین شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001762052.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('b05ef372-f75d-5c3e-8fcc-58b5c68867b4','a96e77af-95af-5ff6-8d83-9d6da197d95b',1,'natural substance under the ground','ماده طبیعی زیر زمین','spoken & written','the thick dark liquid from under the ground from which petrol is produced','[ uncountable ]',null,'نفت، روغن (خام)؛ روغن (سرخ‌کردنی)؛ روغن (موتور)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['discover/find oil Oil was discovered in Saudi Arabia in 1938. How does a company go about finding oil and getting it from the ground?','hit/strike oil (= to find oil when you are digging for it ) The engineers drilled down a few hundred metres until they hit oil. The Ohio Oil Company struck oil on May 3rd.','drill for oil Plans to drill for oil off the New South Wales coast have recently been revived.','produce oil (= to have natural areas of oil, and take it out of the ground ) The US does not produce enough oil to meet its own needs.','extract oil formal (= to take oil out of an area ) the difficult process of extracting the oil','crude oil (= oil in its natural state ) the price of crude oil','refined oil (= oil that has been treated by an industrial process ) They had exported refined oil.','offshore oil (= found under the sea, not far from the coast ) The company has the technical capabilities to produce offshore oil.','heavy/light oil 2,000 barrels of heavy oil are produced a day. The oil corporation announced the discovery of another field of light oil.','oil prices The increase in oil prices has prompted warnings of a global recession.','the oil industry He works in in the oil industry.','an oil company YPF was the state oil company in Argentina.','an oil producer (= a country which produces oil ) The Soviet Union is the world''s largest oil producer.','an oil refinery (= a place where oil is treated by an industrial process ) an oil refinery in Perth','oil production a fall in US oil production','an oil spill (= situation in which oil comes out of a ship or other container into the sea ) a terrible oil spill near the Shetland Islands','an oil crisis (= situation in which there is not enough oil, and the price of oil is very high ) The world is facing an oil crisis.','an oil rig (= structure on land or in the sea with equipment for getting oil out of the ground ) an oil rig in the North Sea']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a rise in the price of oil","translation":"افزایش قیمت نفت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001761519.mp3"},{"sentence":"the importance of protecting our oil supplies","translation":"اهمیت حفاظت از منابع نفتی ما","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001761522.mp3"},{"sentence":"an oil refinery (= factory where oil is made purer )","translation":"پالایشگاه نفت (= کارخانه ای که در آن نفت خالص تر می شود)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001761523.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
