spill near the Shetland Islands','an oil crisis (= situation in which there is not enough oil, and the price of oil is very high ) The world is facing an oil crisis.','an oil rig (= structure on land or in the sea with equipment for getting oil out of the ground ) an oil rig in the North Sea']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Check the oil level in your car every week.","translation":"سطح روغن ماشین خود را هر هفته چک کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000261576.mp3"},{"sentence":"The heating system runs on oil.","translation":"سیستم گرمایش با روغن کار می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001567636.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
