('5d41ad1e-e52f-5b57-b060-66671e07ae2e','1fc38dc3-ff4d-5edf-8de7-e56619a7e744',1,'not new','جدید نیست','spoken & written','something that is old has existed or been used for a long time',null,null,'پیر، قدیمی؛ بزرگ‌سال (سن)؛ کهنه (دوست)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a pair of old shoes","translation":"یک جفت کفش قدیمی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000262085.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some of the houses around here are very old.","translation":"برخی از خانه های اطراف اینجا بسیار قدیمی هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000262086.mp3"},{"sentence":"one of our oldest traditions","translation":"یکی از قدیمی ترین سنت های ما","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000262087.mp3"},{"sentence":"The car’s getting old now, and things are starting to go wrong with it.","translation":"ماشین در حال حاضر قدیمی شده است، و همه چیز شروع به خراب شدن کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000262088.mp3"},{"sentence":"That story’s as old as the hills (= extremely old ) .","translation":"این داستان به قدمت تپه ها (= بسیار قدیمی) است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001567716.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('58a4cd3d-c8e3-5821-a49c-d2d8e661d7ce','1fc38dc3-ff4d-5edf-8de7-e56619a7e744',2,'not young','جوان نیست','spoken & written','someone who is old has lived for a very long time','[ plural ]',null,'کسی که پیر شده است برای مدت بسیار طولانی زندگی کرده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"an old man","translation":"یک پیرمرد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001761580.mp3"},{"sentence":"a home for old people","translation":"خانه ای برای سالمندان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001761581.mp3"},{"sentence":"I can’t run around like I used to – I must be getting old.","translation":"من نمی توانم مانند گذشته بدوم - باید پیر شده باشم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001761584.mp3"},{"sentence":"the care of the old and sick","translation":"مراقبت از پیر و بیمار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001761589.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('ce7a915d-6b4a-5231-9231-2e63fba67115','1fc38dc3-ff4d-5edf-8de7-e56619a7e744',3,'age','سن','spoken & written','used to talk about how long a person or thing has lived or existed',null,null,'برای صحبت در مورد مدت زمان زندگی یا وجود یک شخص یا چیز استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be 5/10/50 etc years old My dad is 45 years old.','a five-year-old/fifteen-year-old etc somebody/something a three-year-old boy','how old is …? ‘How old is your daughter?’ ‘She’s ten.’','be too old for something He was too old for military service.','be old enough to do something You’re old enough to help with the cooking.','somebody is old enough to know better (= used when you think someone should behave more sensibly ) He’s old enough to know better, but he went and did it anyway!','somebody is old enough to be somebody’s mother/father (= used when you think that someone is much too old to be having a relationship with another person ) Why would she want to go out with someone who was old enough to be her father?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I can’t believe you’re nearly forty years old!","translation":"من نمی توانم باور کنم که شما نزدیک به چهل سال دارید!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001567726.mp3"},{"sentence":"a house that’s 300 years old","translation":"خانه ای 300 ساله","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000262114.mp3"},{"sentence":"How old are you?","translation":"چند سالته؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000262111.mp3"},{"sentence":"Are you older than Sally?","translation":"آیا شما از سالی بزرگتر هستید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001567737.mp3"},{"sentence":"You’re old enough to get your own breakfast now.","translation":"اکنون به اندازه کافی بزرگ شده اید که می توانید صبحانه خود را تهیه کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001567727.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m not coming skating. I’m too old for that now.","translation":"من برای اسکیت نمیام من الان برای آن خیلی پیر هستم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001567731.mp3"},{"sentence":"a six-week-old baby","translation":"یک نوزاد شش هفته ای","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000262118.mp3"},{"sentence":"a 500-year-old sword","translation":"یک شمشیر 500 ساله","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020143.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
('5497c7bd-38c1-5180-9a72-406d21efc63f','1fc38dc3-ff4d-5edf-8de7-e56619a7e744',4,'that you used to have','که قبلا داشتی','spoken & written','your old house, job, girlfriend etc is one that you used to have','[ only before noun ]',null,'خانه قدیمی، شغل، دوست دختر و غیره شما همان چیزی است که قبلا داشتید',array['former']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I met up with one of my old girlfriends at the weekend.","translation":"آخر هفته با یکی از دوست دخترهای قدیمی ام ملاقات کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000262126.mp3"},{"sentence":"My old car was always breaking down.","translation":"ماشین قدیمی من همیشه در حال خراب شدن بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000262127.mp3"},{"sentence":"That happened when we were still in the old house.","translation":"این اتفاق زمانی افتاد که ما هنوز در خانه قدیمی بودیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001567743.mp3"},{"sentence":"My old boss was awful!","translation":"رئیس قدیمی من افتضاح بود!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001567744.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('68e546b7-38a6-561e-82c7-3d458df5b32e','1fc38dc3-ff4d-5edf-8de7-e56619a7e744',5,'familiar','آشنا','spoken & written','old things are things that are familiar to you because you have seen them or experienced them many times before','[ only before noun ]','it’s the same old story','چیزهای قدیمی چیزهایی هستند که برای شما آشنا هستند زیرا قبلاً آنها را بارها دیده یا تجربه کرده اید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s good to get back into the old routine.","translation":"خوب است که به روال گذشته برگردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000262160.mp3"},{"sentence":"I enjoyed seeing all the old familiar faces.","translation":"از دیدن تمام چهره های آشنای قدیمی لذت بردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000262161.mp3"},{"sentence":"He comes out with the same old excuses every time!","translation":"هر بار با همان بهانه های قدیمی بیرون می آید!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001567746.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
